<title>UK: London cleared 930 tonnes of gold deals daily-LBMA.</title>
<headline>London cleared 930 tonnes of gold deals daily-LBMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold bullion deals cleared through London averaged 930 tonnes per day during the final quarter of 1996, according to figures released on Wednesday by the London Bullion Market Association (LBMA).</p>
<p>The LBMA was issuing figures on the size of the London-cleared gold market for the first time.</p>
